SUMMARY:ECC 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:European Control Conference\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-1
 0-30\nOfficial source: https://ecc27.euca-ecc.org/\nVenue Radar: https://
 gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ecc-2027\nNotes: Annual flagship of the Eu
 ropean Control Association (25th ECC\; annual since 2013)\, technically c
 o-sponsored by IFAC and IEEE CSS\; accepted papers are published in IEEE 
 Xplore. The July 13-16 window includes the July 13 pre-conference worksho
 ps. On 2026-10-30 the CFP strikes October 31 and gives November 9\, 2026 
 for contributed papers\, invited session proposals and invited session pa
 pers\, which need an organizer's session code. The PaperCept listing says
  no further extensions\, although ECC 2026 extended twice. Industry abstr
 acts need an industry-affiliated author and are not in the proceedings. S
 ubmissions opened September 1 (day only). No hour is published\, so cutof
 fs use provisional end-of-day AoE. Not listed in ICORE2026 or CCF. Size L
  is an editorial category.
CATEGORIES:Control & Robotics,System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics,
 Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos
